    "text": "<voice:25001>Shutting down the quarry is completely\\nabsurd!\\p<voice:25002>That quarry is the lifeblood of this\\ntown. Our work there has been a source\\nof pride for generations of miners!\\p<voice:25003>Why the hell is Dewey allowing this to\\ngo through? Why isn't he fighting it?!\\p<voice:25004>...Hmm? I just realized I've been\\nranting to a complete stranger!\\p<voice:25005>...Wait、 aren't you the swordsman that\\nrescued my son?\\p<voice:65535>...\\p<voice:25006>Sorry. I've just been thinking about the\\nsituation in the quarry a lot lately.\\nAnd every time、 it makes my blood boil!\\p<voice:25007>Ever since they closed it、 the count's\\nmen have been seen going in and out like\\nthey own the place. It's aggravating!\\p<voice:25008>That quarry is far too important to this\\ntown and everyone in it for us to just\\nlook the other way!\\p<voice:25009>...At any rate、 I hear you wiped out all\\nthe monsters down there-- even the big\\nones that nested in the deepest mines!\\p<voice:25010>Even if you're not from Redmont、 you're\\na true friend to this town. Here、 I've\\ngot something for you.\\p",
